    <title>S7 - Systems7 | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="S7 - Systems7 | 1 323 følgere på LinkedIn. Helping the companies that matter to the future outperform the ones who don&amp;#39;t. 
We also host the podcast &amp;quot;WTF Now by S7&amp;quot; | Systems7 – S7 for short  – is an Oslo-based advisory firm that exists to help the businesses that matter to the future outperform the ones that don’t.

Today we are a tight-knit group that loves working together, drawing on deep shared experiences from supporting senior leaders in some of the world&amp;#39;s biggest, most well-known companies.

Through six modular offerings, we help leaders drive transformation in their teams and organisations – in line with the health of the environmental, social, political and geopolitical systems in which they operate.">

