    <section class="core-section-container
        core-section-container--with-border border-b-1 border-solid border-color-border-faint py-4 text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us">
<!---->
          <h2 class="core-section-container__title section-title">
            Om oss
          </h2>

<!---->
      <div class="core-section-container__content break-words">
        

          <p class="break-words text-color-text" data-test-id="about-us__description">
              Systems7 – S7 for short  – is an Oslo-based advisory firm that exists to help the businesses that matter to the future outperform the ones that don’t.

Today we are a tight-knit group that loves working together, drawing on deep shared experiences from supporting senior leaders in some of the world's biggest, most well-known companies.

Through six modular offerings, we help leaders drive transformation in their teams and organisations – in line with the health of the environmental, social, political and geopolitical systems in which they operate.

Offering 1: Developing leaders and teams to enable strategic and commercial aims.
Offering 2: Equipping leadership teams for change.
Offering 3: Building contextual fluency in order to enable decision-making against uncertainty.
Offering 4: Aligning on your company´s strategic direction.
Offering 5: Mobilising the wider organisation, so the people required for implementation understand and support your transformation. 
Offering 6: Accelerating impact performance and moving beyond ESG compliance to impact-driven value creation.
+
Services tailored for portfolio managers – from community-building events for portfolio leaders to 'impact sprints'  to help portfolio companies develop targets and KPIs to drive ESG performance.
+
Inspiring experiences for your leaders and teams – from panels and workshops to large-scale conferences and adventurous field trips in the great outdoors. 

Want to know more? Get in touch: inquiries@systems7.co or visit our website www.systems7.co

We also host the podcast WTF? Now by S7 - for business leaders trying to make sense of a world that's stopped making sense. Check it out on podcast.s7.wtf
          </p>

