        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">We've spent decades helping executive teams mobilise their leaders in service of transformation. Along the way, we've learned a thing or two about what works and - crucially - what doesn't. 

Most transformations fail. And, when they do, it's almost always for one or more of six reasons.

Sound familiar? If this resonates or speaks to something you need help solving for, we'd love to hear from you.</p>
